    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 13 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Cult of the Dragon<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Research</p><p>Extensive records on specific topics, dragons first among them.</p><p><strong>Research: Helpful Lore.</strong> The hireling searches the archive for 7 days and gains knowledge as if they had cast Legend Lore, which they share with you the next time you speak with them.</p><p><strong>Reference Books.</strong> You have Advantage on Intelligence (Nature or Religion) checks you make in your Bastion when you take the Study action to recall lore about Dragons, Tiamat, or the Cult of the Dragon.</p><p><strong>Enlarging the Facility.</strong> For 2,000 GP, it becomes Vast, and you gain two reference books from those of the Archive facility.</p><p><em>Source: Forgotten Realms: Heroes of Faerûn.</em></p>",
